-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:9c683bd51c39ca034ad1c4ce2a11a5e48f1ac0ccae20a1ea0f858f2e1aa883fe","file":"preprints/Additive-hardness-and-unbounded-configuration-gaps-in-bin-packing-September-24-2026/build/source/introduction.tex","line":87,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"9994a72fa58397357ca3aa7f3d19d9c76855f8f330847b1ff990ee42a2f20c30","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Additive-hardness-and-unbounded-configuration-gaps-in-bin-packing-September-24-2026/build/source/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:9c683bd51c39ca034ad1c4ce2a11a5e48f1ac0ccae20a1ea0f858f2e1aa883fe","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Additive-hardness-and-unbounded-configuration-gaps-in-bin-packing-September-24-2026/build/source/introduction.tex#L87"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:unbounded-gap}\nFor every integer $c\\ge0$, there is a finite rational bin-packing instance\n$I$ and an integer $B$ such that every item size exceeds $1/6$ and\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:main-gap}\n  \\LP(I)=B,\n  \\qquad \\OPT(I)>B+c.\n\\end{equation}\nThe equality for the fractional optimum also holds for the configuration\nLP whose patterns are subsets of the individual item copies."}
